## 4. Typography

Font: **Inter** (theme default). Use MUI `variant`:

| Variant | Typical size | Use |
|---------|--------------|-----|
| `h4`–`h6` | 20–34px | Page / section titles |
| `subtitle1` | 16px | Card headers |
| `body1` | 16px | Default body (**preferred**) |
| `body2` | 14px | Secondary body — minimum for long copy |
| `caption` | 12px | Meta, timestamps — **minimum UI text** |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD
<Typography sx={{ fontSize: 11, fontWeight: 800 }}>

// ✅ GOOD
<Typography variant="h5" component="h1">Chuyến đi</Typography>
<Typography variant="body2" color="text.secondary">Cập nhật 5 phút trước</Typography>
```

Buttons: `textTransform: 'none'` (already in theme) — readable sentence-case labels.

---

## 5. Touch & pointer (44px rule)

| Control | Min size |
|---------|----------|
| Primary `Button` | Default height ≥ 40px; full-width on mobile OK |
| `IconButton` (nav, chat, voice) | **44×44 CSS px** — use `sx={{ width: 44, height: 44 }}` |
| Adjacent targets | ≥ **8px** gap between |

```tsx
// ❌ BAD — sole nav control on mobile
<IconButton size="small" onClick={...}>

// ✅ GOOD
<IconButton
  aria-label="Mở menu điều hướng"
  sx={{ width: 44, height: 44 }}
>
```

**Keyboard:** never remove `:focus-visible` without custom focus ring. Tab order must reach all interactive elements.

---

## 6. Layout shells (pick one — do not invent)

### driver-web / customer-web

| Page type | Shell |
|-----------|--------|
| Auth (login/register) | Full-viewport gradient `Box` → centered `Card` `maxWidth={400}`, inner `p: 4` |
| App home (assistant) | `Box minHeight 100dvh` → `HeaderComponent` + scene/chat overlay |
| Content (dashboard, FAQ) | `HeaderComponent` + `Container maxWidth="md"` + standard `py` |
| Info (about, terms) | `Container maxWidth="sm"` |

Mobile nav: `MobileNavDrawer` below `md` — header `px: { xs: 1.5, sm: 3 }`.

### admin-panel / super-admin-panel

| Page type | Shell |
|-----------|--------|
| Login | Standalone full page (no sidebar) |
| Authenticated | **`SettingsShellLayout`** — sidebar 280px @ `md+`, grouped nav + search |

`admin-panel` is dispatcher (Trip Board). `super-admin-panel` is ops (health, live logs, calls) — JWT `super_admin` only.

**One scroll owner per page** — avoid nested scroll traps. Sticky header: pad content below it.

---

## 7. Forms & feedback

- Every field: visible `label` or `aria-label`; error via `FormHelperText` (theme restores margin stripped by CSS reset).
- Loading: disable submit + `CircularProgress` — no silent 3s wait.
- Errors: human-readable Vietnamese/English inline — not raw API JSON.
- Destructive: `Dialog` confirm; destructive action is **not** the primary (filled) button.

---

## 8. Voice / assistant widgets

- `VoiceSessionWidget`: show connecting / live / error state; same contrast + 44px touch rules.
- Chat (`AssistantChatPanel`): **one bubble per utterance**; grow with streaming STT; lock on final transcript.
- Session status visible without opening devtools.

---

## 9. Motion

- `prefers-reduced-motion: reduce` → disable decorative animation (3D scene parallax, pulsing orbs).
- Feedback transitions ≤ **300ms**; loading spinners excepted.

---

## 10. Anti-patterns (reject in review)

- Raw hex in `src/features/**` (`#6c8aff`, `#0d1117`, …)
- Off-grid spacing (`17px`, `22px`, `margin: 13`)
- `IconButton size="small"` as only nav control on mobile
- New authenticated admin/ops page **outside** `SettingsShellLayout`
- Tailwind classes — **not used in this repo**; do not add `className="..."` unless project migrates
- Duplicating `palette.ts`/`theme.ts` differently across the three apps in one PR
- `100vh` without `dvh` on mobile full-screen layouts
- Removing focus outlines globally

---

## 11. Cross-platform alignment (web ↔ mobile)

Same product, same brand:

| Concern | Mobile (`driver-app`) | Web (`driver-web`) |
|---------|----------------------|-------------------|
| Primary brand | `$primary` `#8B5CF6` | `PALETTE.base` / purple gradient headers |
| Min touch | 44pt | 44px |
| Min caption | 12px (`AppText caption`) | 12px (`caption`) |
| Screen gutter | 20px (`Screen`) | 24–32px (`px: 3–4`) |
| Voice UX | Orb + waves | Widget + chat panel |

When changing brand or assistant UX, update **both** unless task is explicitly single-platform.

---

## 12. Definition of done (web UI)

- [ ] Spacing on 8px grid; page `px: { xs: 3, sm: 4 }`
- [ ] Colors from `PALETTE` / theme — no new feature hex
- [ ] Typography via MUI variants; nothing below 12px
- [ ] Primary icon controls 44×44 on mobile width
- [ ] Focus visible; form labels + errors
- [ ] Responsive at 375px and 1024px
- [ ] `typecheck` / `build` / `lint` pass for touched app
- [ ] Voice/chat changes: status visible, one bubble per utterance

See also: `ui-mobile.mdc`, `quality-standards.mdc`.
